WEBVTT

00:26:29.826 --> 00:26:33.006
On the right, it's the tribe,
ethnic nationalism.

00:26:33.030 --> 00:26:34.727
I'm a moderate,

00:26:34.751 --> 00:26:37.983
so I believe the magnetic idea
that really should motivate our lives

00:26:38.007 --> 00:26:39.199
is "love your neighbor,"

00:26:39.223 --> 00:26:41.148
building these communities

00:26:41.172 --> 00:26:43.285
at the local level
and at the national level,

00:26:43.309 --> 00:26:45.461
having a national story
we can all believe in.

00:26:45.485 --> 00:26:47.398
And that process of "love your neighbor"

00:26:47.422 --> 00:26:49.671
is really something
you can devote your life to.

00:26:49.695 --> 00:26:53.199
CA: I mean, a lot of people in both
those other tribes, on right and left,

00:26:53.223 --> 00:26:55.915
would say that they also
believe in "love your neighbor,"

00:26:55.939 --> 00:26:58.422
and that's actually what drives
part of what they do.

00:26:58.446 --> 00:27:00.779
A social justice warrior --
what are they doing